rmc-apc-examine-working =
    Use:
    - An [color=cyan]engineering ID[/color] to lock or unlock the interface.
    - A [color=cyan]crowbar[/color] to open the cover.
    - A [color=cyan]screwdriver[/color] to expose the wires.
rmc-apc-examine-wires-exposed = Use a [color=cyan]screwdriver[/color] to unexpose the wires or a [color=cyan]crowbar[/color] to open the cover!
rmc-apc-examine-cover-open-battery = Use an [color=cyan]empty hand[/color] to remove the battery or a [color=cyan]crowbar[/color] to close the cover!
rmc-apc-examine-cover-open-no-battery = Use a [color=cyan]battery[/color] to put in a battery!

rmc-apc-no-skill = You don't know how to use the {$apc}'s interface.
rmc-apc-cover-locked = The cover is locked and cannot be opened.
